Basic Concepts

1. Compute Paradigms

QUENNE QCPU supports three computing paradigms:

Quantum Computing:

· Superposition and entanglement
· Hardware-native quantum gates
· Error correction included

Neuromorphic Computing:

· Spiking neural networks
· Event-driven processing
· Online learning support

Classical Computing:

· High-performance Arm cores
· Vector extensions
· Unified cache hierarchy

2. Cognitive Fusion

The Fusion Engine automatically selects the best paradigm:

